  "source": "Inepro Metering, \"PRO380 Series user manual\", V2.18-8, appendix A3 (Modbus register map)",
  "sources": [{"title": "PRO380 Series user manual", "version": "V2.18-8", "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6617f74190bf0a53bfd776e8/69f0b42e8df8da5157fb250d_PRO380%20user%20manual%20V2.18-8.pdf", "note": "Appendix A3.2, Modbus register map; linked from the PRO380-Mod product page"}],
  "notes": [
    "All registers are holding registers read with FC03. Settings are written with FC06 (one register) or FC10 (floats).",
    "Floats are IEEE 754 in ABCD order (high word first).",
    "Defaults: address 1, 9600 baud, 8 data bits, even parity, 1 stop bit. Baud rate can be lowered to 4800, 2400, 1200, 600 or 300; parity can be none or odd.",
    "Power is given in kW, kvar and kVA, energy in kWh and kvarh.",
    "The registers of the old V1.14 map still work but are not in this map. The table's average voltage (0x5000) and current (0x500A) are marked as PRO1 only and are left out."
  ],
